 "result": "**Decorator:** `@needs_app_scope` (`src/tessel/cli.py:380`). You usually don't need to apply it yourself. Registering with `@app.cli.command()` or `@AppGroup.command()` wraps the callback in it automatically (`src/tessel/cli.py:405-427`). Pass `needs_app_scope=False` to opt out.\n\n**App loader:** `LaunchInfo` (`src/tessel/cli.py:293`). Its `load_app()` method (`src/tessel/cli.py:333`) loads the app. The `tessel` CLI group itself is `TesselGroup` (`src/tessel/cli.py:531`), a subclass of `AppGroup`.",
